en space. Conveniently located near the Henday, transit, shopping, and much more, this home offers easy access to all that Edmonton has to offer. Welcome home. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$479,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,560 sq ft"],["Lot size","4,400 sq ft"],["Year built","2003"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Macewan"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6W1M4"],["MLS® number","E4506740"],["Listed","September 3, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, See remarks, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Electric"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.92 m × 4.10 m (12'10\" × 13'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.03 m × 3.05 m (9'11\" × 10'0\")"],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.00 m × 4.20 m (13'1\" × 13'9\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.83 m × 3.08 m (9'3\" × 10'1\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.81 m × 3.38 m (9'3\" × 11'1\")"]],"courtesy":"Jennifer Elander Bianchini, RE/MAX Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"macewan","area":"southwest-edmonton"}